{
  "description": "启动一个复用当前执行引擎的自主子任务，按父任务冻结的模型和参数，自行取材、调用获授权工具、修订并交付候选文件。sources点名已授权来源，默认取当前打开稿及资源；sourceVersion=disk显式选磁盘版。可选target沿已观察project/path及region传当前frame、局部viewport和相关外围事实，纯素材任务可省略；sharedBrief提供必要共同约定和用户已有费用意愿，role仅为专业偏好，outputs点名相对成果。宿主授予独立候选空间，不提供主文档写权。返回job与真实子运行身份；用job.wait等待、delegate.read回读，返回source直接交project.apply from一次采用同组依赖与当前region，无需逐文件保存或父模型重写长源码。适合可独立交付单元，不需固定角色流水线或强制时长/token预算。每个父任务默认最多同时运行两项原生子任务；达上限时先等待或取消现有作业，不要重复派工。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$defs": {
      "__schema0": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema1": {
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "__schema2": {
        "type": "number"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "goal": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
      },
      "outputs": {
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
        },
        "minItems": 1,
        "type": "array"
      },
      "role": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
      },
      "sharedBrief": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema0"
      },
      "sources": {
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "sourceVersion": {
        "enum": [
          "current",
          "disk"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "target": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
          },
          "project": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema1"
          },
          "region": {
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "height": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2",
                "exclusiveMinimum": 0
              },
              "transform": {
                "prefixItems": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "array"
              },
              "width": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/__schema2",
                "exclusiveMinimum": 0
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "width",
              "height",
              "transform"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "goal",
      "outputs"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
